    <item>
      <title>[翻译] Simon Willison: 二维码生成器</title>
      <link>https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/15/qr-code-generator/#atom-everything</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;标签:&lt;/strong&gt; #二维码 #工具 #AI&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;摘要:&lt;/strong&gt; 作者借助 Claude 开发了一款二维码生成器，支持为文本、URL 以及 WiFi 网络快速生成可扫描的二维码。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#888;font-size:13px;"&gt;原标题: QR code generator&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr/&gt;
&lt;h3 style="margin:24px 0 12px;"&gt;Tool:&lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;QR code generator&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#2c2c2e;margin:4px 0 24px;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;"&gt;工具：&lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;QR code generator（二维码生成器）&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div style="color:#9a9ea6;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:20px 0 6px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;Claude&lt;/strong&gt; helped me build this tool for creating &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;QR codes&lt;/strong&gt;, for both &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;text/URLs&lt;/strong&gt; and for connecting to &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;WiFi&lt;/strong&gt; networks.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#2c2c2e;margin:4px 0 24px;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;Claude&lt;/strong&gt; 帮我构建了这个用于生成 &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;QR codes（二维码）&lt;/strong&gt; 的工具，支持为 &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;text/URLs（文本/网址）&lt;/strong&gt; 以及连接 &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;WiFi（无线网络）&lt;/strong&gt; 创建二维码。&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;img src="https://static.simonwillison.net/static/2026/qr-code-generate.jpg" alt="Screenshot of a QR code generator web form. Heading &amp;quot;QR code generator&amp;quot; with subtitle &amp;quot;Create a scannable code for a URL, text, or WiFi network.&amp;quot; A segmented toggle shows &amp;quot;URL / text&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;WiFi&amp;quot; with WiFi selected. Below are fields: &amp;quot;Network name (SSID)&amp;quot; with placeholder &amp;quot;My WiFi&amp;quot;; &amp;quot;Password&amp;quot; with placeholder &amp;quot;Password&amp;quot; and a blue &amp;quot;Show&amp;quot; link; &amp;quot;Security&amp;quot; dropdown set to &amp;quot;WPA / WPA2 / WPA3 (most common)&amp;quot;; an unchecked &amp;quot;Hidden&amp;quot; checkbox; helper text &amp;quot;Not sure? Leave it on WPA / WPA2 / WPA3 — that covers almost every home WiFi network.&amp;quot; Below that: &amp;quot;Style&amp;quot; dropdown set to &amp;quot;Square&amp;quot;, an unchecked &amp;quot;Border&amp;quot; checkbox, &amp;quot;Size&amp;quot; dropdown set to &amp;quot;Medium&amp;quot;, and a &amp;quot;Color&amp;quot; swatch showing black. At the bottom is a blue &amp;quot;Generate QR code&amp;quot; button." style="max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin:12px 0;"/&gt;

&lt;img src="https://static.simonwillison.net/static/2026/qr-code-generate.jpg" alt="Screenshot of a QR code generator web form. Heading &amp;quot;QR code generator&amp;quot; with subtitle &amp;quot;Create a scannable code for a URL, text, or WiFi network.&amp;quot; A segmented toggle shows &amp;quot;URL / text&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;WiFi&amp;quot; with WiFi selected. Below are fields: &amp;quot;Network name (SSID)&amp;quot; with placeholder &amp;quot;My WiFi&amp;quot;; &amp;quot;Password&amp;quot; with placeholder &amp;quot;Password&amp;quot; and a blue &amp;quot;Show&amp;quot; link; &amp;quot;Security&amp;quot; dropdown set to &amp;quot;WPA / WPA2 / WPA3 (most common)&amp;quot;; an unchecked &amp;quot;Hidden&amp;quot; checkbox; helper text &amp;quot;Not sure? Leave it on WPA / WPA2 / WPA3 — that covers almost every home WiFi network.&amp;quot; Below that: &amp;quot;Style&amp;quot; dropdown set to &amp;quot;Square&amp;quot;, an unchecked &amp;quot;Border&amp;quot; checkbox, &amp;quot;Size&amp;quot; dropdown set to &amp;quot;Medium&amp;quot;, and a &amp;quot;Color&amp;quot; swatch showing black. At the bottom is a blue &amp;quot;Generate QR code&amp;quot; button." style="max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin:12px 0;"/&gt;

&lt;div style="color:#9a9ea6;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:20px 0 6px;"&gt;Tags: &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;vibe-coding&lt;/strong&gt;, tools, &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;generative-ai&lt;/strong&gt;, ai, &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;llms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#2c2c2e;margin:4px 0 24px;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;"&gt;标签：&lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;vibe-coding（氛围编程）&lt;/strong&gt;、tools（工具）、&lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;generative-ai（生成式 AI）&lt;/strong&gt;、ai（人工智能）、&lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;llms（大语言模型）&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr/&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 &lt;a href="https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/15/qr-code-generator/#atom-everything"&gt;阅读原文&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
